<title>UK: Scotia cancer drug as good as Biotech's.</title>
<headline>Scotia cancer drug as good as Biotech's.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drug discovery group Scotia Holdings Plc said on Tuesday that late stage trials show its EF13 pancreatic cancer drug &quot;is at least as good as Marimastat,&quot; the ground-breaking compound under development by rival British Biotech Plc.</p>
</text>
